{"id":"645e23d166674b47","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy.md","title":"非确定型时间层级定理","display":"thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy — 非确定型时间层级定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy","aliases":["28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy"],"display":"thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy — 非确定型时间层级定理","depends_on":["[[28-df-time-constructible]]","[[28-df-ntime]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 3.2","source_printed_pages":"69–70","source_pdf_pages":"95–96","source_status":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy — 非确定型时间层级定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35bdb2233dfc3e43\" href=\"?note=35bdb2233dfc3e43\" title=\"28-df-time-constructible\">28-df-time-constructible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7514d356710d2e51\" href=\"?note=7514d356710d2e51\" title=\"28-df-ntime\">28-df-ntime</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"69–70"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"95–96"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 属于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35bdb2233dfc3e43\" href=\"?note=35bdb2233dfc3e43\" title=\"28-df-time-constructible\">28-df-time-constructible</a> 的时间可构造函数类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NTIME}\">\\(\\mathrm{NTIME}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7514d356710d2e51\" href=\"?note=7514d356710d2e51\" title=\"28-df-ntime\">28-df-ntime</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{f(n+1)}{g(n)}=0\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NTIME}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{NTIME}(g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{f(n+1)}{g(n)}=0\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NTIME}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{NTIME}(g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书的假设是f(n+1)=o(g(n))，不能直接替换成f(n)=o(g(n))。本次比对一般陈述并读其线性对n^{1.5}的懒对角特例；未完整补出一般模拟和分段时钟证明，故此节点不作为已核验依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 3.2；印刷 pp.69–70 / PDF pp.95–96。本次核对范围：对应陈述；证明边界见本节，未升级为完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-time-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"35bdb2233dfc3e43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-time-constructible]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ntime","status":"resolved","id":"7514d356710d2e51","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntime]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-time-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"35bdb2233dfc3e43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$ 属于 [[28-df-time-constructible]] 的时间可构造函数类；$\\mathrm{NTIME}$ 见 [[28-df-ntime]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ntime","status":"resolved","id":"7514d356710d2e51","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$ 属于 [[28-df-time-constructible]] 的时间可构造函数类；$\\mathrm{NTIME}$ 见 [[28-df-ntime]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{f(n+1)}{g(n)}=0\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NTIME}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{NTIME}(g).","display":true}],"bytes":1451,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c3d3fd9c681563f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathrm{NTIME}$ 见所列本地定义；层级结论采用 [[28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy]] 的证据边界。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-281","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy]]、[[28-cor-np-neq-nexp]]、[[28-df-expcom-oracle]]、[[28-prop-expcom-oracle-collapse]]。"}],"outgoing":["35bdb2233dfc3e43","7514d356710d2e51"]}